Package: tama-asr
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: TamaASR contributors
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: fcitx5, libc6, libstdc++6, libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libxss1, libgbm1, libasound2 | libasound2t64
Conflicts: meloasr
Replaces: meloasr
Description: Web-backed voice input for Fcitx5
 TamaASR hosts supported web speech-recognition backends and sends their
 live corrected text to the active Fcitx5 input context.
